    "Welcome to KerNotch": {
      "comment": "The onboarding window's title bar. Lives in the app target's catalog rather than KerNotchUI's because the window is built by the composition root, which resolves against the main bundle.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welcome to KerNotch"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch'a hoş geldiniz"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Willkommen bei KerNotch"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Te damos la bienvenida a KerNotch"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bienvenue dans KerNotch"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ti diamo il benvenuto in KerNotch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "not saved": {
      "comment": "Stands in for the report path when the diagnostics report could not be written.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "not saved"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "kaydedilmedi"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "nicht gesichert"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "no guardado"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "non enregistré"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "non salvato"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch could not start listening for agent updates.": {
      "comment": "Alert title shown when the loopback listener for agent hooks fails to start.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch could not start listening for agent updates."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch, aracı güncellemelerini dinlemeye başlayamadı."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch konnte nicht beginnen, auf Agent-Updates zu hören."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch no pudo empezar a escuchar las actualizaciones de los agentes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch n'a pas pu commencer à écouter les mises à jour des agents."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch non è riuscito a iniziare ad ascoltare gli aggiornamenti degli agenti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent status will not appear in the notch until listening starts. Turn the agent off and on again, or restart KerNotch.": {
      "comment": "Alert detail shown when the loopback listener for agent hooks fails to start.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent status will not appear in the notch until listening starts. Turn the agent off and on again, or restart KerNotch."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dinleme başlayana kadar aracı durumu çentikte görünmez. Aracıyı kapatıp yeniden açın ya da KerNotch'u yeniden başlatın."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Agent-Status erscheint erst in der Notch, wenn das Zuhören beginnt. Schalte den Agenten aus und wieder ein oder starte KerNotch neu."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El estado del agente no aparecerá en la muesca hasta que empiece la escucha. Desactiva y vuelve a activar el agente, o reinicia KerNotch."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'état de l'agent n'apparaîtra pas dans l'encoche tant que l'écoute n'a pas commencé. Désactivez puis réactivez l'agent, ou redémarrez KerNotch."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo stato dell'agente non comparirà nel notch finché l'ascolto non inizia. Disattiva e riattiva l'agente, oppure riavvia KerNotch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch could not read its settings.": {
      "comment": "Launch alert title when settings.json exists but cannot be read.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch could not read its settings."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch ayarlarını okuyamadı."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch konnte seine Einstellungen nicht lesen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch no pudo leer sus ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch n'a pas pu lire ses réglages."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch non è riuscito a leggere le sue impostazioni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "KerNotch is using default settings for now and will not save changes. Launch at Login, the app language and agent hooks are left exactly as they are. Check that this file belongs to you, then restart KerNotch: %@": {
      "comment": "Launch alert detail when settings.json cannot be read. Placeholder is the settings file path.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch is using default settings for now and will not save changes. Launch at Login, the app language and agent hooks are left exactly as they are. Check that this file belongs to you, then restart KerNotch: %@"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch şimdilik varsayılan ayarlarla çalışıyor ve değişiklikleri kaydetmeyecek. Açılışta başlatma, uygulama dili ve ajan hook'larına dokunulmadı. Bu dosyanın size ait olduğunu kontrol edip KerNotch'u yeniden başlatın: %@"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch verwendet vorerst die Standardeinstellungen und sichert keine Änderungen. „Beim Anmelden öffnen“, die App-Sprache und die Agent-Hooks bleiben genau so, wie sie sind. Prüfe, ob diese Datei dir gehört, und starte KerNotch dann neu: %@"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch está usando los ajustes por omisión y no guardará los cambios. El arranque al iniciar sesión, el idioma de la app y los hooks de los agentes quedan intactos. Comprueba que este archivo es tuyo y reinicia KerNotch: %@"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch utilise pour l'instant les réglages par défaut et n'enregistrera aucune modification. L'ouverture à la connexion, la langue de l'app et les hooks des agents restent inchangés. Vérifiez que ce fichier vous appartient, puis redémarrez KerNotch : %@"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "KerNotch sta usando le impostazioni di default e non salverà le modifiche. L'avvio all'accesso, la lingua dell'app e gli hook degli agenti restano invariati. Verifica che questo file sia tuo, poi riavvia KerNotch: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
